{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Excuse me, are all these puppets handmade?",
        "zh": "您好，这些都是手工制成的木偶吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 1,
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectID": "f3c78097-f6b9-4192-82c6-457003e8c026",
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager3_3",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager3_3",
          "methodName": "CameraZoomIn_3_3",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerTiming": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Of course! This craft has been passed down for generations!",
        "zh": "那当然！这可是代代流传下来的手艺！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Look at the patterns here... tsk, tsk, and the carving details here…",
        "zh": "你看这里的花纹，啧啧，再看这里的雕刻细节......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(He seems really passionate about puppets.)",
        "zh": "（他似乎相当热衷于木偶。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": -1
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(Wait, the strings connecting these puppets look a bit like the ones I saw on the plane.)",
        "zh": "（等等，连接这些木偶的丝线，和我在飞机上看到的有些类似。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(Maybe I can find out how to deal with those strings.)",
        "zh": "（或许能打听出对付那些丝线的手段。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Sorry to bother you. I actually collect puppets as a hobby.",
        "zh": "打扰了，其实我有收藏木偶的爱好。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh! Then you’ve come to the right place! Yuntai’s handmade puppets are famous, you know.",
        "zh": "噢！那你可来对了地方了！我们芸台的手作木偶可是很有名气的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "That’s exactly why I’m here. I’ve bought some puppets from Yuntai before.",
        "zh": "我正是慕名而来，之前也在芸台购置过一些木偶。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "It’s just that, the puppets I collect, their strings often snap on their own and I can never figure out why.",
        "zh": "只是我保存的木偶，丝线常常会自己断裂，却又找不到原因。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "The strings snapping, huh… If it’s not external damage, it could be a temperature issue.",
        "zh": "丝线断裂啊......如果不是被外物破坏，那有可能是温度因素影响。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Temperature?",
        "zh": "温度？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yep. The oldest local puppet-making methods used spider silk to connect the joints.",
        "zh": "嗯，我们本地最古老的木偶做法，便是使用蛛丝连接木偶关节的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "These days almost no craftsmen use real spider silk anymore, but locals still use light, fine thread that imitates it.",
        "zh": "虽然现代基本已经没有完全使用蛛丝的匠人了，但本地人还是会用较轻而细，能够仿照蛛丝的丝类进行替代。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Lantern Vendor",
        "zh": "花灯摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Puppets made this way move more lightly, but they’re also more sensitive to temperature.",
        "zh": "这样做出的木偶活动起来更加轻盈，但是也更易受温度影响。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "If the temperature gets too low or too high…",
        "zh": "如果温度太低或太高的话......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "name": {
        "en": "Puppet Vendor",
        "zh": "木偶摊主",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/男孩父亲 1",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "<color=orange>High temperatures will cause the threads to soften and dissolve; low temperatures make them brittle and easy to snap.</color> So you have to control the temperature when storing them.",
        "zh": "<color=orange>温度太高丝线会溶解，太低则容易脆化断裂</color>，所以保存时要控制好温度。",
        "ja": ""
      },
